  "boundary_reasoning": [
    "Actual production default selectors tail-forward save/restore/copy into one full Rust object. Final map owns each new helper and accepted predecessor helper at .ltext.<name> in rust/mckernel_rust.o. Static C restore_default shim is optimized into actual idle/signal default consumers; no unused-symbol cutover claim.",
